### 占位示例；Token/ID/version由开发者自行替换，禁止提交真实凭据。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@token = <ACCESS_TOKEN>
@org = 201
@ticket = 301

### 读取最新版本
GET {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/tickets/{{ticket}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 领取；200，OPEN且version+1；相同请求再次提交409
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/tickets/{{ticket}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_version":0}

### 领取后单独开始处理；使用刚返回的版本
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/tickets/{{ticket}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_version":1,"to_status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### 评论不增加工单版本
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/tickets/{{ticket}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"已开始检查问题。"}

### 查事件
GET {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/tickets/{{ticket}}/events?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 伪造受理人必拒绝400
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/tickets/{{ticket}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_version":0,"assignee_id":102}
